{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "altfonbooth-api",
    "name": "Altfon Booth API",
    "description": "Altfon Booth REST API. Endpoints grouped by client surface:\n\n- **Web** (`/api/*`) - modern web app: subscriber auth, SIP accounts, destinations, payments\n- **Admin** (`/api/admin/*`) - admin dashboard (manager/super_admin roles)\n- **Mobile (Legacy)** (`/api/v1/*`) - legacy CodeIgniter surface for the mobile app (CI-style envelope)\n\nApplies to: signup near-signal. Auth via JWT Bearer token.\n\n## Auth\n- **Web**: `Authorization: Bearer <token>` from `POST /api/signup` -> `POST /api/verify` then `POST /api/login`\n- **Admin**: `Authorization: Bearer <token>` from `POST /api/admin/login`\n- **Mobile (Legacy)**: `Authorization: Bearer <access_token>` from `POST /api/v1/login`\n\n## Mobile (Legacy) envelope note\nAll `/api/v1/*` responses use a CI-style envelope: `{ status, error:{code,message}, reason }` on failure and `{ status, code, data, message }` on success.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "https://appapi.altfon.com"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "adminToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "mobileToken",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Web",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Auth",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Signup",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/signup",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "signup"]
                },
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"johndoe\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\",\n  \"confirm_password\": \"password123\",\n  \"phonenumber\": \"233201234567\",\n  \"fullname\": \"John Doe\",\n  \"emailaddress\": \"john@example.com\",\n  \"country\": \"Ghana\"\n}",
                  "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
                },
                "description": "Public. Rate: 5/min. Creates a temp subscriber and sends an OTP via SMS/email. Returns `debug_otp` (dev only).\n\nFields: username (unique), password (min 8), phonenumber (unique), fullname, emailaddress, country."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Verify OTP",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/verify",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "verify"]
                },
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"phonenumber\": \"233201234567\",\n  \"otp\": \"123456\"\n}",
                  "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
                },
                "description": "Public. Rate: 5/min. Verifies the OTP and creates the permanent subscriber + default SIP account. Provide either `phonenumber` or `subscriberid`, and either `otp` or `code`."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Login",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/login",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "login"]
                },
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"johndoe\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}",
                  "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
                },
                "description": "Public. Rate: 5/min. `username` may be username or email. Returns `token` and `user`. If registration is still pending, re-issues an OTP instead."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Request Password Reset",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/password/request",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "password", "request"]
                },
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"john@example.com\"\n}",
                  "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
                },
                "description": "Public. Rate: 5/min. Sends a 6-digit password reset code to the subscriber's email/phone."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Reset Password",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/password/reset",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "password", "reset"]
                },
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"123456\",\n  \"password\": \"newpassword123\",\n  \"confirm_password\": \"newpassword123\"\n}",
                  "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
                },
                "description": "Public. Rate: 5/min. Resets the password using the code from `/api/password/request`. Password min 8."
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Account & SIP",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Get Current User",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/user",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "user"]
                },
                "description": "Auth (web token). Rate: 60/min. Returns the authenticated subscriber's profile."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Update Profile",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/update-profile",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "update-profile"]
                },
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"fullname\": \"John Q. Doe\",\n  \"emailaddress\": \"john.doe@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"optionalnewpass\"\n}",
                  "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
                },
                "description": "Auth (web token). Rate: 60/min. Update fullname, emailaddress, password."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Get My Destinations",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/my-destinations",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "my-destinations"]
                },
                "description": "Auth (web token). Rate: 60/min. Returns the current subscriber's destinations."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "List Auth Users (My SIP Accounts)",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth-users",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "auth-users"]
                },
                "description": "Auth (web token). Rate: 60/min. Returns the subscriber's own SIP accounts (authusername, authpassword, balance, status)."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Add Auth User (Create SIP Account)",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth-users",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "auth-users"]
                },
                "description": "Auth (web token). Rate: 60/min. No body needed - server auto-generates unique 6-digit authusername and 8-char authpassword. Returns both."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Update Auth Username",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth-username",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "auth-username"]
                },
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"authusername\": \"654321\"\n}",
                  "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
                },
                "description": "Auth (web token). Rate: 60/min. Updates the default SIP username for the subscriber. Must be digits."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Update Auth Account",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/update-auth-account",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "update-auth-account"]
                },
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"id\": 1,\n  \"authusername\": \"654321\",\n  \"authpassword\": \"newpass12\"\n}",
                  "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
                },
                "description": "Auth (web token). Rate: 60/min. Update an existing auth account by its DB `id` and authusername."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Delete Auth User",
              "request": {
                "method": "DELETE",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth-users",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "auth-users"]
                },
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"authusername\": \"654321\"\n}",
                  "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
                },
                "description": "Auth (web token). Rate: 60/min. Deletes the SIP account and all related destinations."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Get Balance",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/get-balance",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "get-balance"]
                },
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"authusername\": \"123456\"\n}",
                  "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
                },
                "description": "Auth (web token). Rate: 60/min. Returns balance for an owned SIP account. 403 if the authusername isn't yours."
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Destinations",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Add Destination",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/destinations",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "destinations"]
                },
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"authusername\": \"123456\",\n  \"destination\": \"0245678901\"\n}",
                  "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
                },
                "description": "Auth (web token). Rate: 60/min. destination max 20 chars. 403 if SIP account isn't yours."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Delete Destination",
              "request": {
                "method": "DELETE",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/destinations",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "destinations"]
                },
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"authusername\": \"123456\",\n  \"destination\": \"0245678901\"\n}",
                  "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
                },
                "description": "Auth (web token). Rate: 60/min. destination max 20 chars."
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Payments",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Get Payment Config",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/payments/config",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "payments", "config"]
                },
                "description": "Public. Returns the Paystack public key (never the secret)."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Initialize Payment",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/payments/initialize",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "payments", "initialize"]
                },
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"authusername\": \"123456\",\n  \"amount\": 100,\n  \"email\": \"john@example.com\"\n}",
                  "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
                },
                "description": "Auth (web token). Rate: 20/min. Initializes a Paystack transaction. `email` optional (falls back to subscriber profile). Paystack uses amount in kobo internally."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Verify Payment",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/payments/verify",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "payments", "verify"]
                },
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"reference\": \"PAYSTACK_REFERENCE_ID\"\n}",
                  "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
                },
                "description": "No auth required (Paystack is source of truth). Rate: 20/min. Verifies a Paystack reference and credits the account. Reference: alphanumeric, `_` and `-` only, max 128. Idempotent - reprocessing returns 'Payment already processed'."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Get Purchase History",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/purchase-history",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "purchase-history"]
                },
                "description": "Auth (web token). Rate: 60/min. Returns the subscriber's credit/purchase history."
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Admin",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Auth & Profile",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Admin Login",
              "request": {
                "auth": {
                  "type": "noauth"
                },
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/login",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "admin", "login"]
                },
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"admin\",\n  \"password\": \"adminpass\"\n}",
                  "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
                },
                "description": "Public. Rate: 5/min. Returns `token`. Use it to populate the `adminToken` variable for the /api/admin/* folder."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Get Dashboard",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/dashboard",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "admin", "dashboard"]
                },
                "description": "Admin auth (manager+). Rate: 60/min. Totals and recent subscribers/transactions."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Update Profile",
              "request": {
                "method": "PUT",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/profile",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "admin", "profile"]
                },
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Admin User\",\n  \"email\": \"admin@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"optionalnewpass\"\n}",
                  "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
                },
                "description": "Admin auth (manager+). Rate: 60/min. Update admin name/email/password."
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Subscribers",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "List Subscribers",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/subscribers",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "admin", "subscribers"]
                },
                "description": "Admin auth (manager+). Rate: 60/min."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Get Subscriber",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/subscribers/:id",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "admin", "subscribers", ":id"]
                },
                "description": "Admin auth (manager+). Rate: 60/min. `id` is the subscriberid (e.g. SUB_XXXX)."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Create Subscriber",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/subscribers",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "admin", "subscribers"]
                },
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"fullname\": \"Jane Doe\",\n  \"username\": \"janedoe\",\n  \"emailaddress\": \"jane@example.com\",\n  \"phonenumber\": \"0241112222\",\n  \"country\": \"Ghana\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}",
                  "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
                },
                "description": "Admin auth (manager+). Rate: 60/min."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Update Subscriber",
              "request": {
                "method": "PUT",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/subscribers/:id",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "admin", "subscribers", ":id"]
                },
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"fullname\": \"Jane Q. Doe\",\n  \"switch_status\": \"active\",\n  \"billing_acc_status\": \"active\"\n}",
                  "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
                },
                "description": "Admin auth (manager+). Rate: 60/min. Partial update supported."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Delete Subscriber",
              "request": {
                "method": "DELETE",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/subscribers/:id",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "admin", "subscribers", ":id"]
                },
                "description": "Admin auth (manager+). Rate: 60/min. Deletes subscriber + all related data (auth users, destinations, credits)."
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "SIP Accounts (Auth Users)",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "List Auth Users",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/auth-users",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "admin", "auth-users"]
                },
                "description": "Admin auth (manager+). Rate: 60/min. Returns authusername + balance + status. Note: authpassword is NOT included (trimmed)."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Get Auth User",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/auth-users/:id",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "admin", "auth-users", ":id"]
                },
                "description": "Admin auth (manager+). Rate: 60/min. authpassword NOT included."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Create Auth User",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/auth-users",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "admin", "auth-users"]
                },
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"subscriberid\": \"SUB_XXXX\",\n  \"authusername\": \"112233\",\n  \"authpassword\": \"optionalpass\",\n  \"status\": \"active\"\n}",
                  "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
                },
                "description": "Admin auth (manager+). Rate: 60/min. authpassword optional (auto-generated if omitted). Response includes generated password."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Update Auth User",
              "request": {
                "method": "PUT",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/auth-users/:id",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "admin", "auth-users", ":id"]
                },
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"authpassword\": \"newpass12\",\n  \"status\": \"inactive\"\n}",
                  "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
                },
                "description": "Admin auth (manager+). Rate: 60/min."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Delete Auth User",
              "request": {
                "method": "DELETE",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/auth-users/:id",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "admin", "auth-users", ":id"]
                },
                "description": "Admin auth (manager+). Rate: 60/min. Deletes the SIP account + related destinations + credits."
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Destinations",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "List Destinations",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/destinations",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "admin", "destinations"]
                },
                "description": "Admin auth (manager+). Rate: 60/min."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Get Destination",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/destinations/:id",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "admin", "destinations", ":id"]
                },
                "description": "Admin auth (manager+). Rate: 60/min."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Create Destination",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/destinations",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "admin", "destinations"]
                },
